t(4, 1330, """China buying oil from the United States is a clear signal from China to encourage the United States to plunge further into the war, by presenting the Chinese state as one that seeks only its interests and has no strategies. What is laughable is when someone appears in a video telling people that China abandoned its ally, sold it out and decided on permanent cooperation with the United States, accusing people of not understanding politics!!

China sent an encouraging signal to the United States meaning: plunge deeper, we do not care! Positions in wars change every 5 minutes according to events on the ground, so tugs of war are the master of the situation in wars. But this is the current strategic position, outwardly an ongoing trade partnership between China and the United States, and outwardly great Chinese indifference to what is going on and happening, yet the whole world knows of the Chinese support for Russia through satellites and other means. But what is on the screens is not like what goes on behind the scenes, and every party has its strategic goal, but the United States here has no strategic goal in this Chinese game except that it will sink further into the mud.""")

t(4, 2030, """Russia's oil production capacity knocked out completely because of Ukraine's strikes! Anger does not happen in two minutes ..
It rises, then grows, and rises, then rises and grows!""")

h(4, 2400, """The moment of complete anger!""")

t(5, 735, """From SWIFT to Vostro .. the end of a world and the beginning of a world!
SWIFT means that no nation can trade with another nation except through an American bank, and this means a percentage the American bank takes from every purchase deal made in the world daily, and this means that both nations trading with each other must buy and hold the American dollar! The SWIFT world lasted for very long decades!

Vostro means the ability of any nation to trade with another nation without the transaction passing through an American bank! This means the two trading nations no longer need to buy the American dollar at all, and this is happening for the first time in long decades! Not buying the dollar simply means the fall of the dollar!

Vostro is a system that began years ago, but the great nations such as China, Russia, India, the Muslims and the nations of South America did not use it widely out of fear of the United States.

The Vostro system is a new trade exchange system in which even Arab states took part, using it in their trade with nations such as China, India, Russia and others.

Since this new and historic matter began, the United States has realized that it is exposed to toppling and that its end is near! This matter has triggered the Samson-and-the-temple equation!""")

t(5, 1520, """Psychological distance is decisive in closeness or estrangement! As a human being, you must find excuses for those who chose estrangement, for the great effort they try to undertake! Some people are a truth walking on the earth, and these are tiring for the opposite human component! Over the years a repeated question has reached me, revolving around: Why do they hate me? The asker may mean his relatives, his brothers, his children, his parents, his wife or her husband! But the matter is not always an expression of hatred, so the likely question is also: Why do they move away? Not necessarily why do they hate!

Before maturity you may look at this dilemma in your personal life only from the angle of possible hatred, but when your life experience is complete you will understand that the reason is not always hatred; rather there is a reason deeper than hatred! Hatred may appear in many of its cases as an expression of triviality and shallowness, but what is deeper is that vast distance between a person's truth and the inability of those around him to keep pace with him in that truth!

A person representing truth (the power of conscience) in the midst of a social human component causes a great problem for that human surrounding, because this person will possess a high self-power (a high ability to express conscience in practice) that makes others flee from him so as not to see that power, because it is a glaring reminder that the degree of their inner power (their conscience) is lower. So they flee to feel only the level of their own self-power, and to coexist with the level of their self-power away from the stronger model that unsettles them or reminds them that there is someone stronger than them, making their lives unstable. Thus either the feeling of deficiency or the feeling of inability to compete always clings to them, even if the context is basically not one of competition but of coexistence and cooperation, where the man of conscience lives his life quite naturally and does not remind them of the weakness of their conscience, trying to coexist without dropping or selling the constants, but they from their angle see only the value of competition in this disordered tug.

So people fleeing from one another is not necessarily their hating one another! There is something hidden inside the self that makes many people shunned and abandoned, because the party who abandons feels the wearying distance between himself and a "few in number" human component whose self-power is activated, which, if it appears, disturbs the other and does not comfort him. Hence the question that must be asked about incomprehensible and illogical social reactions will remain: Why do they move away?! And not: Why do they hate?!

And in the context of estrangement, the image of this abandonment will always reveal the fact that the one who abandons cannot bridge the distance between""")

t(6, 150, """his inner weakness, which he hides, and the strength of the other party, so that the matter looks like an attempt at separation in time, place and soul, all of it being no more than flight to protect the self from splintering and fragmentation. So the question can never be phrased as most people always think: Why do they hate me? Now it becomes clear to the asker that the matter is deeper and bigger, and that the crisis is much bigger than mere hatred, otherwise a solution would have been possible!""")

h(6, 1100, """This is the reason!""")

t(6, 1400, """I want to say to everyone who met me face to face over all those long years (over 21 years exactly) and heard from me about the future, and mocked and ridiculed what I used to say about ((the future of the world)) and about this world and what is coming in it .. I want to say something!

I do not feel any pity for anyone who will live astonishment and psychological collapse, and the feeling of the disappointment that will befall him, because he will wake up to the truth of everything he used to mock and ridicule!

I do not feel sorrow for a mocker and wrongdoer, whether he attacked face to face or attacked behind closed doors, while he/she will soon be in a state of shock at what is coming, and in a state of having lost the chance to take precautions and care and to benefit from knowledge that was there to benefit, not to harm!

I do not feel any feelings toward those who mocked, wronged and bullied, face to face or in secret!

Today, tomorrow, the day after and throughout the year, everyone who wronged, mocked, ridiculed and attacked will know which of the two sides was right about the coming truths of the world!

I wish you much astonishment, wonder and amazement, and realization of the size of the mistake you committed.. We were all together in a very long test in this life, which has lasted 21 years since I began advising and speaking .. and after the test the results will appear, Allah the Exalted willing! And when the results appear, by Allah's might, the price of mockery, ridicule, bullying and insult, openly or secretly, will simply be the price of a person feeling that he made a great mistake, and that he did wrong and committed what was not right to commit!""")

