t(13, 890, """Every crookedness in minds is caused by love of self or love of this world, and this world is not loved without glorifying the self, adoring it, and seeking immortality for it in the abode of extinction; and here the mind becomes crooked and retreats and cannot see clearly and perceive, and a great multitude of people are swept toward the culture of the single team (the culture of crowds) - (the behavior of blind imitation) - if people (the majority) said something, you said it with them, if people (the majority) believed something, you believed with them, and if people (the majority) analyzed, thought and concluded, you analyzed, thought and concluded with them!""")

